# behavior: 5 former snapshots stdlib cases run in order, each program from its own module: loops_over_calls_returning_iterator_adopters, std_async_module_error_names, std_data_module_names, std_logging_telemetry_names, std_prelude_and_traits_names
# expect-stdout:
#  [10, 11, 12, 10, 11, 15, 16, 10, 7, 8, 20, 21, 1, 2, 30]
